OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists angry as car problems
OL,4,Ashut Asda petrol station pumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome motorists are angry after they
OL,7,Fsaid their cars developed problems
OL,8,Fafter refuelling at an Asda petrol
OL,9,Fstation.
OL,11,FSandra Reid is among the people who
OL,12,Fhave reported issues with their
OL,13,Fvehicles after buying fuel from the
OL,14,Fsame Asda-owned forecourt.
OL,16,FShe said her car started to "chug along
OL,17,Fand struggle to accelerate" and
OL,18,Feventually broke down, after leaving
OL,19,Fthe filling station.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
