OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists angry as car problems
OL,4,Ashut Asda petrol station pumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsda has apologised for any
OL,7,Finconvenience and removed some pumps
OL,8,Ffrom service at the site in question
OL,9,Fwhile an investigation is carried out.
